claim.claim-text:
transporting mission extension pods from an orbit in space to one or more target spacecraft with a host ship;
positioning the host ship proximate the one or more target spacecraft;
transferring one or more of the mission extension pods to the one or more target spacecraft; and
ceasing physical contact between with the host ship and the one or more of the mission extension pods after the one or more of the mission extension pods are transferred to the one or more target spacecraft.
